    "heading": "Level 3: Bard Subclass",
    "lineStart": 2500,
    "lineEnd": 2502
  },
  "section": "3.41",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Bard subclass of your choice. The College of Lore subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Bard levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Bard level or lower."
}
